  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Partner Investment Fund PIF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project creating for Yemen Partner Investment Fund (PIF), where Oxfam Great Britain (GB) in Yemen within next three and a half years will provide flexible funds to its partners to encourage creative ideas, implementation of new initiatives and activities, support gaps for support cost of partners, disabled communities, and strengthening capacities of marginalized Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) and Women&apos;s Rights Organisations (WROs). Thus, partners&apos; strategies and vision will be met rather than Oxfam or donors ones.</narrative>
  </description>
